Date: Wed, 26 Aug 2026 05:34:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] version - 2026.08.25

- Fixed a bug in "VorbisAudioRTPSource" that could have caused a malicious SDP description to
  crash a RTP client.  (Thanks to 'Tristan' for reporting this.)
